<title>POLAND: Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares end mixed in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>BPH, Stalexport and Universal fell and Budimex and Rolimpex rose in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Monday.</p>
<p>Bank Slaski was flat and the remaining four stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>Total turnover rose to 2.4 million zlotys from Friday's 1.1 million.</p>
<p>NFI units fell in 18.2-million-zloty trade.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
